pkg:Evidence_v1_18_0 a quality:Evidence, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Gate transcript for code-abundance-rdodi v1.18.0 (STORY-6 closed -- real page ABox built)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "MINOR: resolved the widget-intention design question via direct investigation of the real page's own JS rather than the old click-to-reveal pattern -- found a genuine per-concept interaction (framework citations + typed relation chips, independently clickable), confirmed live via Playwright before writing any triple. A technical judgment resolvable through investigation, proceeded without needing further user input. Built code_abundance_page_abox_v1_3_0.ttl: 18 ChapterSections (one per real Stage 2 leaf concept), 18 InstructionalWidgets instantiating a new, honestly-distinct primitive, 7 real LearningObjectives. Re-ran every applicable real gate fresh: Stage4.A/B PASS, Cross.B PASS (18/18 chains), Stage4.H/I/J PASS, Stage4.K intention coverage PASS -- 18/18 covered, 0 disclosed-scope, genuinely stronger than the old ABox's own result (declared LOs, zero widgets ever linked). Deliberately did not close the Epic in the same pass -- that deserves its own careful check, the exact discipline that caught a premature closure two turns ago. Re-verified: pipeline order unaffected, full SHACL 0 violations."@en ;
    pub:transcriptSHA256 "53f9a6a6390b3b69e812f554bfcaa135c12569fdbc268481a335ae2d5ca75c21"^^xsd:string .
